{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "51bec742-8a2b-876b-9916-f7ba35f62e4a",
  "created_at": "2026-01-07T09:50:52-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Margaret Brownell",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:46:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:46:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, hello? Good morning? I hope I have the right office? I'm wondering about a fence?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:46:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You've got the right place. What's the question on the fence?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:46:22-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I want to put one up along the back of the property? Along the back line, where the yard ends? And I need to know if I need a permit? For a fence?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:46:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can you tell me a little about it first? How tall, what material?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:46:43-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, um, it would be black aluminum? The kind with the little pickets on top? And it would be four feet tall? Or, no, wait, I wrote six feet, didn't I? Hold on, I'm putting you on the speaker so I can look through my papers? Can you hear me all right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:47:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:47:09-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you? Now, the man who gave me the estimate wrote down six feet along the back? But he said the aluminum is four feet? So I'm not sure which it is? I'm a little mixed up, I'm sorry?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:47:25-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No need to apologize. So that's the thing to nail down first, because height matters. Is the plan a four-foot fence or a six-foot fence along the back line?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:47:38-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think I want six feet along the back? But the black aluminum he showed me was four? Is that possible? That they'd be different?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:47:49-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's possible the estimate mixes two things, or aluminum panels come in a few heights. Either way, call the contractor and have him confirm the exact height in writing. To answer your main question, generally yes, a fence usually needs a permit here, and the height is one of the things that gets looked at. Six feet in the back is something they'll want to review."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:48:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh? So I do need a permit? Even for the aluminum kind? Because it's see-through, you know? I thought maybe that was different?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:48:26-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Open style versus solid can matter for some rules, but I wouldn't count on it getting you out of a permit. Plan on applying."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:48:37-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right? And do I have to tell the neighbor? The one behind me? Do they get a letter or something? Or do I have to knock on the door?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:48:50-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't think the city sends your neighbor a letter for a regular fence. But it's a good idea to tell them anyway, and you want to be sure the fence is on your side of the line. Do you have a survey of the property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:49:09-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A survey? Um, is that a map? I have some papers from when I moved in? I rent, you see? The landlord owns it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:49:20-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's important. If you're renting, the owner has to be on board. Typically the owner signs the application or gives written permission. So talk to your landlord before anything else."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:49:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, my goodness? I didn't think of that? So it's not me that applies? It's him?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:49:40-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Either one of you can usually take it in, but it needs his okay. Let me say it back so it's clear. One, get the exact height from the contractor. Two, get your landlord's permission. Three, apply for a fence permit through this office. Four, let the back neighbor know as a courtesy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:50:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me write that down? Slowly? Height, landlord, permit, neighbor? Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:50:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:50:10-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And where do I get the form? Do I come down there? Or is it in the mail?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:50:18-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can stop by City Hall and pick one up at our counter, or the landlord can look on the city website. Counter's open during the day on weekdays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:50:31-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay? I think I understand? Mostly? I may call back if the numbers are still mixed up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:50:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Just ask for Zoning and Inspections."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:50:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Lombardi? Was it Lombardi?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:50:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Greg is fine. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T09:50:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, goodbye?"
    }
  ],
